          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मुँह — mũh — \"the mouth; the face\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खाने से पहले मुँह और हाथ धो लो। khāne se pahle mũh aur hāth dho lo. Wash your face and hands before eating."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मुँह (mũh) is a tadbhava: CDIAL lists Hindi mũh, \"mouth, face\", under Sanskrit múkha, \"mouth, face\" (CDIAL 10158); the kh wore down to h and left a nasal vowel."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
